CCTPBridgeModule_EstimateOutput
├── when params length is less than minimum encoding size
│   └── it should return (0, token)
├── when mint recipient is zero
│   └── it should return (0, token)
├── when maxFee equals amount
│   └── it should return (0, token)
├── when maxFee exceeds amount
│   └── it should return (0, token)
└── when all checks pass
    ├── it should return (amount - maxFee, token)
    ├── it should return full amount when maxFee is zero
    └── it should return correct estimate for any valid amount [fuzz]
